 	<li><strong>Centralized Control</strong>: Wrapper components allow you to encapsulate common functionality or styles in one place, reducing duplication.</li>
 	<li><strong>Reusability</strong>: By abstracting shared logic or behavior, they make it easier to use the same functionality across multiple components.</li>
 	<li><strong>Extensibility</strong>: Wrapper components enable easy customization without affecting the core component structure.</li>
 	<li><strong>Adherence to SOLID Principles</strong>: They align with SRP by ensuring that each component focuses on one responsibility, keeping logic modular and maintainable.</li>
